OL,3,GNEWSAMajor disruption warning at
OL,4,Astation for track upgrades
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe majority of rail services into or
OL,7,Fout of Liverpool Lime Street station
OL,8,Fwill be disrupted by track upgrades on
OL,9,FSunday.
OL,11,FRail passengers are being urged by
OL,12,FNetwork Rail to check before they
OL,13,Ftravel as most services will be
OL,14,Fimpacted by track maintenance in the
OL,15,FMossley Hill area, a key approach to
OL,16,FLiverpool Lime Street.
OL,18,FThe track foundation stone, known as
OL,19,Fballast, is being strengthened and
OL,20,Fsecured.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,406,400,260,160,0,100
